2. REQUIRED — §4.1: let TTS_VOICE actually take effect
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Three endpoints hardcode "onyx" as the request default, which always beats the
env var because it arrives as an explicit argument. Drop the literal and let
narration.resolve_voice() apply the precedence (request > TTS_VOICE > onyx).

