That one call now does: pronunciation dictionary + markdown/PMID stripping
(§4.2), OpenAI-primary with gTTS fallback (§4.1), the sidecar timestamp map
(§4.3), and the per-character cost row (§4.5).

The sidecar lands at generated_media/<audio_id>.timestamps.json — the same
directory and stem _persist_media() uses for the MP3 — so _persist_media needs
NO change and the Media tab keeps working as-is.

