6. OPTIONAL — serve the timestamp map to the web deck (Agent B's consumer)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Nothing exposes the sidecar over HTTP yet. One route, next to the other media
routes (~app.py:3780):

    @app.route("/api/media/<media_id>/timestamps")
    def media_timestamps(media_id: str):
        tmap = narration.load_timestamp_map(media_id)
        if not tmap:
            return jsonify({"error": "No timestamp map for this audio"}), 404
        return jsonify(tmap)

Gate it the same way the sibling media routes are gated.
